# fw_printenv and fw_setenv configuration
#
# This must match UBOOT_ENV_OFFSET/UBOOT_ENV_COUNT in
# fwup_include/fwup-common.conf (sector 1024 = 512 KB = 0x80000, 128 KB).
# There is no U-Boot on this system; the block is only the Nerves metadata
# store, shared between fwup and nerves_runtime.

# Device name	Device offset	Env. size	Flash sector size	Number of sectors
/dev/nvme0n1	0x80000		0x20000		0x200			256
